  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;parameters, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math>is equal to",
